external_services.shapes:
Every call is a POST with a JSON body. The response is {"result":T} or {"error":{"message":string,"code":number}}.

- login
  - Request: {type:"Login",email,password,facebook:false}
  - Response: {authKey,user:{_id,email,avatar?,fbId?,lastModified,dateRegistered,premium_expire?,gdpr_consent,trakt?}}
- loginWithToken
  - Request: {type:"LoginWithToken",token}
  - Response: same as login
- logout
  - Request: {type:"Logout",authKey}
  - Response: {success:true}
- getUser
  - Request: {type:"GetUser",authKey}
  - Response: User. Error code 1 means the session expired.
- addonCollectionGet
  - Request: {type:"AddonCollectionGet",authKey,update:true}. Harbor sends {authKey,type:"user",update:false}.
  - Response: {addons:[{manifest,transportUrl,flags:{official,protected}}],lastModified}
- addonCollectionSet
  - Request: {type:"AddonCollectionSet",authKey,addons:[...full list...]}
  - Response: {success:true}
- datastoreMeta
  - Request: {authKey,collection:"libraryItem"}
  - Response: [[id,mtimeMs],...]
- datastoreGet
  - Request: {authKey,collection:"libraryItem",ids:[...],all:bool}. Use ids:[] with all:true to get everything.
  - Response: [LibraryItem]
- datastorePut
  - Request: {authKey,collection:"libraryItem",changes:[LibraryItem]}
  - Response: {success:true}

LibraryItem = {_id,name,type,poster?,posterShape,removed,temp,_ctime?,_mtime,state:{lastWatched?,timeWatched,timeOffset,overallTimeWatched,timesWatched,flaggedWatched,duration,video_id?,watched?,noNotif},behaviorHints:{defaultVideoId?,featuredVideoId?,hasScheduledVideos}}. Times are in ms and integers. `watched` = "{anchorVideoId}:{len}:{base64(zlib(bits))}".
